and `ent ν T = ofReal (hPart ν T P)`) but not for a general generating sequence.

(2) **One-step generator route.**  Using the fleet's `EKLC6Comp.hPart_le_add_Hcond` with a
finite partition `P` satisfying `partSigma P ≤ A` and `σ(S) ⊆ orbitSigma t P := ⋁_{i∈ℤ} comap (T^[i]) (partSigma P)`
one gets `hPart μ T Q ≤ hPart μ T P + Hcond μ Q (orb P ⊔ past Q) ≤ hPart μ T P + Hcond μ Q A = hPart μ T P`
for every `Q` with `partSigma Q ≤ A`, whence `ent μ T = sup_l hPart μ T (F l) ≤ hPart μ T P`; and
